{"id":"vod_sn_37439","vodId":"37439","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"青出于蓝第一季","name_cn":"青出于蓝第一季","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/19fad32bd354476fdd139b1faa4b1262.jpg"},"summary":"表面上，花菱薰（保志总一朗 配音）是一个普通的少年，但在年幼时，薰有着非常悲惨的身世。薰的父亲是声名显赫的花菱财阀的掌门，而母亲只是一介平民，为此，母亲受了不少的苦，甚至遭到了逐出家门的无情命运。为此，薰一直耿耿于怀，最终选择离开了庞大的家族独自生活。　　这天，一个名叫樱庭葵（川澄绫子 配音）的女子来到了薰的身边，原来，葵是薰的青梅竹马，从小就结下了婚约。由于薰的离开，花菱家取消了薰和葵的婚约，而葵此行的目的，就是为了当面向薰询问消息的虚实。被葵的真情打动，薰和葵开始了他们的同居生活，一段让人津津乐道的爱情佳话就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/twhfM2uaVa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/2Uj9jPa5Ku1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/VGfDSWx4aj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/bNykK6EUe91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Hxae4CikTX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/V0T2qjv7U41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Z88jx4eq5N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/9uaX8ZnU9B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/cGM3F42qxd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/YrdXPq6cS81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/aM4fKNYhwL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/29w3dNbDGv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/W9kPVxLCR31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/5edzsCjvXu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.